WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:06.190
Florida has fired the scientists who created
their coronavirus dashboard that tracks most

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.540
states have something like this.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:11.639
It tracks daily cases and deaths and other
data.

00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:16.789
And it is alleged that she has been fired
because she was refusing to manipulate or

00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:22.849
I would call it falsified data for political
reasons to make reopening seem like a more

00:00:22.849 --> 00:00:24.339
reasonable thing to do.

00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:26.839
Now, this scientist's name is Rebecca Jones.

00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:31.911
She put together these dashboards so that
you could go and see in real time where are

00:00:31.911 --> 00:00:35.160
the outbreaks, where the cases and deaths.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.150
She wasn't paid for this additional work that
she did.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.450
She did it over a two month period.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:47.579
And it is claimed that she was told to censor
or manipulate some data and she refused to

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:48.579
do it.

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:54.600
She was told to manually change some data
to help build the case that reopening makes

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.780
sense.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:00.269
And she refused to do it, as she says, and
she has now been fired.

00:01:00.269 --> 00:01:06.460
Now, the interesting thing about this coming
out of Florida is that I guess it was almost

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.850
two weeks ago, I think I was on the not the
last Friday show, but the previous one or

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:13.090
maybe the one before that time is all blending
together.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.930
We had reports from a few weeks ago that Florida
was already being accused of being dishonest

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:25.400
about their deaths and they were shielding
cause of death from these reporting agencies.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.740
This, if true, is North Korea style propaganda.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:33.729
Too many deaths and cases to reopen just make
up different numbers.

00:01:33.729 --> 00:01:35.020
No problem whatsoever.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:39.460
And again, I think it's important to underscore
that a lot of the headlines say that she was

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.780
refusing to manipulate data.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:49.229
She was refusing to falsify data, selectively
releasing data or changes or manipulation.

00:01:49.229 --> 00:01:50.540
This is falsification.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.399
It would be a form of fraud or straight up
lies.

00:01:53.399 --> 00:01:58.950
They are doing what Trump and Republicans
have been accusing China of doing.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:01.850
They are doing what Trump and Republicans
have been said.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.220
You know, maybe the death tolls are being
overstated.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:08.520
Well, it looks like they are being accused
of doing the exact thing, although in the

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.890
opposite direction, to make this seem less
bad than it actually is.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:17.730
Now, of course, there are always details that
are late coming in.

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:20.280
What she straight up fired or forced to resign?

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.280
It's not clear.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.330
She's not communicating very much.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:28.090
Rebecca Jones is with with reporters over
the last 12 to 16 hours.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.470
What exactly was she asked to change?

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:31.890
We're not really sure yet.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:38.500
What was observed was that over the last couple
weeks, the demographic info about who is getting

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:42.100
infected and dying has been more difficult
to access.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.300
As one example, reporters have been having
more and more trouble finding out how many

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:51.340
cases and deaths are coming from Long-Term
Care in nursing home type facilities and prisons,

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:54.710
which are big hotspots for outbreaks of coronavirus.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:03:00.570
At one point, as I told you, the Florida state
government prevented stopped medical examiners

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:05.390
from releasing death totals and also cause
of death.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:09.260
And both of those things were being done there
for for for many, many years.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:10.840
That was standard operating practice.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:12.580
We reported on that already.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.430
And as usual, we still don't have transparency
in terms of the full scope of what they're

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.010
hiding or potentially falsifying.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.860
We do need to get more of the story from Rebecca
Jones.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:26.660
She hopefully will be more communicative with
reporters in the upcoming period of time.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:31.630
Now, in terms of the numbers that Florida
has been releasing, you know, earlier in the

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:37.710
week I mentioned when you look at some states
that have been open versus closed, you see

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.840
very similar curves.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:44.220
And we speculated this could be because an
open state might have a lot of people isolating

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:49.690
on their own, whereas a closed state might
have a lot of people ignoring the protocol.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.580
It could be that states are falsifying data.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.820
We don't really know.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:58.550
In terms of the numbers that Florida has released
the case, numbers have been declining pretty

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:03.380
modestly, sort of a similar pattern to states
that have been mostly shut down.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.990
Maybe a question mark in light of this recent
revelation in terms of the deaths.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:13.340
There is a strange sort of herky jerky up
and down graph for Florida deaths.

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:18.830
Sometimes when you see that it has to do with
reporting intervals where certain days of

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:23.650
the week you don't get full data and numbers
are pushed around potentially.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.390
You know, often it's weekends, the numbers
go down.

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.510
And it's not because fewer people are dying
on the weekend.

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:33.370
It's because the reporting is pushed to Monday
and Tuesday and tallied early in the following

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.370
week.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.100
We're not really sure in terms of testing
levels.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:42.210
Florida is testing about 33000 per million.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.880
That puts them at twenty seventh in the United
States.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:45.880
That's right.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:46.880
About the middle.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.130
Florida is not particularly good or bad on
testing.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:53.200
But again, this is what they are releasing.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:55.010
And that's all we really know.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:58.500
We may know more soon, as I say, but we may
not.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.650
And that's the whole point that.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:05.600
This is a story about the fact that we are
not being given information that is absolutely

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:10.110
necessary to figure out what's going on in
Florida to determine are they ready to move

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:13.350
to a phase one or phase two reopening or whatever
the case may be.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:18.300
Once again, it's projection that the right
has been saying that the left is falsifying

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.540
data for a while now.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:26.190
No actual evidence of that, but now increasingly
evidence that it is the right that may be

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.280
indeed doing that.

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:32.860
And the very right wing Florida state government
of Governor Ron DeSantis is at the at the

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:33.492
center of this at this point in time.

